  "solution": "BODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0087c51a627aa2994f53ae221b2e8565a1579aaec08235bba22bc6c66fe4357e.png] \n\nGiven: By Interchanging '4 and 6' and checking the option:\n\nOption 1) 18 × 7 ÷ 6 – 4 = 17\n\nAfter interchanging '4 and 6':\n\n⇒ 18 × __**7 ÷ 4**__ – 6 = 17\n\n⇒ __**18 × 1.75**__ – 6 = 17\n\n⇒ __**31.**____**5 – 6**__ = 17\n\n⇒ 25.5 ≠ 17.\n\nOption 2) 4 + 6 × 2 – 3 = 9\n\nAfter interchanging '4 and 6':\n\n⇒ 6 + __**4 × 2**__ – 3 = 9\n\n⇒ __**6 + 8**__ – 3 = 9\n\n⇒ __14 - 3__ = 9\n\n⇒ 11 ≠ 9.\n\nOption 3)** ****6 ÷ 2 – 4 × 3 = –16**\n\nAfter interchanging '4 and 6':\n\n⇒ __**4**____** ÷ 2**__ – 6 × 3 = –16\n\n⇒ 2 – __**6 × 3**__ = –16\n\n⇒ __**2**____** – (**__**__-18)__** = –16\n\n⇒ **-16** = -16.\n\n**L.H.S = R.H.S**\n\nOption 4) 6 ÷ 3 + 9 – 4 = 7\n\nAfter interchanging '4 and 6':\n\n⇒ __**4**____** ÷ 3**__ + 9 – 6 = 7\n\n⇒ __**1.33**____** + 9**__ – 6 = 7\n\n⇒ __**10.33 – 6**__ = 7\n\n⇒ 4.33 ≠ 7.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
